      "text": "Semiotics is not just a theoretical framework — it is an analytical tool applicable to any domain where meaning is produced and interpreted. This guide covers three major applied domains: advertising (the designed manipulation of sign systems for commercial ends), architecture (built space as sign system), and code (programming languages as semiotic objects)."
